&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of digital&amp;nbsp;platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good in communication&amp;nbsp;and ability to present well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Would prefer&amp;nbsp;candidates from&amp;nbsp;agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persuasiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pro-activeness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
