&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 6-8 Years of experience handling offline and Digital&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in handling FMCG clients in top agencies is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;E-commerce and digital is musts have&lt;/li&gt;
