&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In 3 Months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thorough understanding of the client&#39;s business: KPIs, user acquisition goals, category dynamics, and competitive context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in account processes, internal tools, and Mindshare x Xaxis workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering high-quality, responsive output on day-to-day client requests with minimal escalation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In 6 Months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of the BFSI digital media landscape, including competitive spend patterns across key category players&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established relationships with key digital media owners and platforms relevant to financial services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded into specialist teams (Xaxis, Strategy, Business Science) with a clear collaborative rhythm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized by the client as the senior daily contact, making proactive contributions to planning sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In 12 Months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting with the client on business outcomes, not just media delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading all planning responses end-to-end: from insight to strategy to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving incremental revenue opportunities and supporting scope and fee conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing structured feedback and development guidance to junior team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-Day Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage the account as the primary Mindshare point of contact for the client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead digital media strategy and planning across branding and performance mandates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and review media plans across OLV, CTV, Programmatic, Social, SEM, and Hyperlocal channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benchmark costs across partners and ensure plans are competitively priced and well-justified&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the Xaxis relationship for programmatic planning and execution, maintaining SLAs and quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track competitive media activity in the category and bring intelligence into client conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend and lead client meetings, internal reviews, and partner discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate client briefs into structured, insight-led media solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with specialist teams (Strategy, Business Science, Content) for integrated deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support award entries, case study development, and thought leadership as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Have Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6-10 years of media agency experience, with a significant portion in digital media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mandatory: demonstrated experience working on BFSI brands (banking, insurance, broking, fintech, or investment platforms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with digital branding campaigns across large-scale, multi-city mandates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience managing clients independently at a senior or leadership level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven full-funnel media experience: from awareness and consideration (OLV, CTV, Display, Programmatic) through to performance and conversion (SEM, Retargeting, App Install, Lead Generation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design and execute campaigns that address different funnel stages simultaneously, with distinct KPIs, messaging, and channel logic at each level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of digital partners across OLV, CTV, Programmatic Display, Social (Meta, YouTube), SEM, and Hyperlocal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of cost benchmarks across digital formats and the ability to validate and negotiate partner rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and reviewing integrated digital media plans with clear rationale for channel mix, budget allocation, and targeting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on involvement in campaign implementation, trafficking coordination, and delivery tracking, not just planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the programmatic ecosystem: DSPs, SSPs, DMPs, brand safety tools, and measurement frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Brand Lift, Search Lift, and attribution methodologies relevant to BFSI advertisers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking: ability to read data, identify trends, and translate into strategic action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, with the ability to present clearly to senior clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail in plan documents, trackers, client notes, and presentation decks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple workstreams simultaneously without compromising quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong team player with the ability to manage upward, laterally, and with vendor partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specific experience on stock broking, mutual fund, or investment platform accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to CTV/OTT media buying (JioHotstar, SonyLIV, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with platforms such as DV360, The Trade Desk, Meta Ads Manager, and Google Ads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of SEBI advertising guidelines and BFSI-specific disclaimer norms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in sports marketing, including high-profile sponsorship properties such as IPL: managing linear TV + CTV buys, sponsorship integrations, and delivering reach at scale during live sporting events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to award entries or case study development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Associate Director of Business Development (SME)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the driving force behind WPP Media’s growth in the high-potential Small and Medium Enterprise (SME) sector. You will hunt, pitch, and secure fast-growing, ambitious mid-market brands, translating WPP’s enterprise-grade media capabilities into agile, high-ROI, and scalable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly entrepreneurial role. You will lead end-to-end sales pitches, navigate shorter sales cycles, and build direct, high-impact relationships with SME founders, CMOs, and decision-makers, positioning WPP Media as their ultimate growth partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting of the role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports to the Director on the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3 best things about the job:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurial Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Run your own portfolio. You will have the autonomy to identify high-growth SMEs, tailor bespoke media propositions, and directly impact WPP Media’s revenue pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fast-Paced Impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Unlike long enterprise pitch cycles, the SME space is fast, dynamic, and highly rewarding. You will see the direct impact of your won pitches on client business growth almost immediately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unrivaled Scale &amp;amp; Access:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Enjoy a unique hybrid experience—operate with the agility of a boutique startup agency while leveraging the massive tech stack, proprietary tools, and global network of WPP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measures of success&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In three months, you would have:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastered WPP Media’s offerings and packaged them into highly compelling, simplified, and digestible propositions for SME prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built a healthy, active pipeline of qualified SME prospects and initiated initial chemistry meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborated with internal teams to build customized, agile pitch templates tailored for mid-market budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In six months, you would have:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led and closed your first set of SME pitches, meeting defined quarterly revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated hands-on knowledge of how to scale WPP’s programmatic, search, and social offerings to suit SME budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In 12 months, you would have:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established WPP Media as a highly competitive player in the regional SME market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently led and converted a consistent stream of new business pitches, fostering a repeatable playbook for SME client acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities of the&amp;nbsp;role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the Pitch Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Own the end-to-end business development lifecycle—from lead generation and qualification to chemistry meetings, RFP responses, and final pitch presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative Selling:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Deeply understand the unique pain points of SMEs (e.g., tight cash flows, need for immediate ROI, lean marketing teams) and consultatively pitch tailored, scalable media solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplify the Complex:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Translate WPP&#39;s sophisticated, multi-channel media tools, data capabilities, and strategies into clear, actionable, and business-focused growth plans for SME stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Partner with planning, buying, and digital specialist teams to design agile, realistic media plans that respect SME budgets while maximizing business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Building:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Anchor conversations and build high-trust, direct relationships with SME founders, business owners, and marketing directors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Keep a pulse on market trends, competitor agency offerings in the SME space, and emerging high-growth industries to proactively target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Minimum of 6 years of experience in media planning, client servicing, or business development, with at least 1 year in a dedicated sales/BD or growth role. Experience pitching to or working with SMEs/mid-market brands is highly advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SME Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A strong understanding of performance marketing, direct-to-consumer (DTC) trends, local media activation, and how to drive immediate, measurable business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Superb Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellent presentation, storytelling, and negotiation skills. You must be comfortable presenting to C-suite/Founder level prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agility &amp;amp; Grit:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A proactive, self-starter attitude with the resilience to navigate fast-moving sales pipelines and shorter turnarounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Spirit:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A team player who can coordinate seamlessly with internal product and execution teams to deliver winning pitch responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
