&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open &lt;/strong&gt;environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the &lt;strong&gt;Global Operations Centre (GOC)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will work closely with teams across the United States, Europe, and Asia to deliver high-impact solutions in a collaborative, multicultural environment. We are looking for an Associate Director Cross channel who will do:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client &amp;amp; Channel Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the lead and primary point of contact for key digital marketing channels—including Search, Social, Programmatic Buying Units (PBU), Ad Operations, or Commerce (all or couple of them). Represent the Global Operations Center (GOC) in all channels wise agency/market interactions, ensuring expectations are managed and consistently met. Serve as the custodian of activation excellence for assigned channels, driving trust and accountability across global stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Activation &amp;amp; Performance Oversight&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the activation, and optimization of campaigns across multiple channels and designated markets. Ensure flawless execution that aligns with broader media strategies and brand objectives. Work in close partnership with local and regional teams to maintain consistency, enhance performance, and deliver measurable impact through detailed reporting and actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Business Partnership&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain strong relationships with internal market teams (Europe, U.S., Asia, MEA, AUNZ), agency partners, and cross-functional groups. Act as a strategic advisor, offering data-driven solutions tailored to regional needs while upholding global standards. Partner with leadership and internal clients to drive innovation, resolve challenges, and influence strategic decisions that contribute to business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and manage scalable workflows and Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) to enhance operational efficiency, campaign quality, and consistency. Enforce compliance with global taxonomy, quality assurance, and platform governance standards. Analyze operational data and feedback to identify improvement areas, ensure process adherence, and escalate issues to the appropriate stakeholders for resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Talent Development&lt;/strong&gt; Lead, mentor, and develop a high-performing team of subject matter experts responsible for campaign execution, optimization, and reporting. Foster a collaborative, accountable, and growth-oriented team culture. Ensure efficient team resourcing, continuous skills development, and alignment with organizational objectives through regular feedback, coaching, and performance evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation, Automation &amp;amp; Business Growth&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify new business opportunities within existing accounts and emerging markets. Collaborate with directors and senior leadership to develop compelling discussions for onboarding new scopes of work. Champion the adoption of internal and external automation tools and technology solutions to drive operational efficiency and future-proof activation capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordination with internal team &lt;/strong&gt;to overall smooth running for operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this opportunity looks right for you, we are looking for candidates who have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduation or Post Graduation Degree in Any stream&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+&amp;nbsp;year&#39;s&amp;nbsp;professional experience in digital media execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an expert &amp;amp; executed on respective channel platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in Microsoft Excel and Google Sheet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge in HubSpot, Smartly, 4C, Scibids, or third-party tools like Dataroma, Google Studio is an added advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multi-location media activation teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience training and maintaining quality standards at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience providing service to local teams from a centralized location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for everything digital, with an active interest and understanding of online advertising industry trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess a solution-oriented mindset and analytical skillset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, display exemplary leadership with a positive go-getter attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open &lt;/strong&gt;environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a sales role. This is a thinking role - one that sits at the intersection of culture, creativity, and commercial strategy. As a Brand Solutions Manager at Goat, you will decode client briefs, identify white spaces in culture, and build idea-led solutions that don’t just win pitches - they move the needle for brands. You are a revenue enabler: the creative intelligence that makes the sale possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You are the person in the room who has already thought of 10 ideas before the brief has been fully read out. Every ad you watch is both a case study and a jumping-off point. You don’t consume content - you interrogate it.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decode client briefs and translate them into sharp, culturally resonant content and creator-led solutions that drive measurable funnel impact - from awareness through to conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot emerging trends on Instagram, YouTube, and new-age platforms before they peak - and proactively build brand ideas around them, not after them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect end-to-end brand solutions - influencer strategy, social-first IPs, branded content, platform-native formats - that go well beyond a standard campaign deck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build compelling, narrative-driven presentations and own the room during client pitches with clarity, conviction, and creative authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the sales team to strengthen proposals and improve win rates - you are the intellect behind the pitch, not the person chasing the number.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal agency teams - strategy and data - to package raw ideas into sellable solutions with a clear brand impact story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in brand solutions, creative strategy, or content planning - at a content agency, influencer platform, digital media house, or branded entertainment team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuinely restless creative brain - you watch a TV commercial and your mind spawns 10 spin-offs, alternatives, and what-ifs, instinctively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-hand fluency with Instagram, YouTube Shorts, and creator culture - you can predict what will trend, not just recognise what already has.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep grasp of influencer marketing currency - creator-audience trust, niche communities, content formats, and the economics of the creator economy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional deckbuilding and presentation skills - you structure a narrative, make every slide earn its place, and hold a room with confidence and wit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to connect brand objectives with content ideas - you think in funnels, not just in formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Superpower&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trend prediction &amp;amp; cultural intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief decoding &amp;amp; insight mining&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Idea generation at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creator &amp;amp; influencer strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pitch &amp;amp; presentation craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Funnel-driven content thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gift of gab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Role Is Not For You If -&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You need a trend report to tell you what’s trending.&lt;br&gt;You can’t tell the difference between a viral reel and a strategic one.&lt;br&gt;Your idea of a great pitch deck is a template with new logos.&lt;br&gt;You’re looking for a pure sales or account management role.&lt;/p&gt;
