&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Data Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong analytical acumen to interpret complex data, derive actionable insights, and present compelling recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Presentation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Exceptional verbal and written communication, presentation, and negotiation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ability to think strategically, identify client challenges, and develop innovative, data-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellent organizational skills, attention to detail, and ability to manage multiple projects in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Business, Communications, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local Market Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Understanding of the Indian digital advertising landscape and local market nuances is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
