&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open &lt;/strong&gt;environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Global Operations Centre (GOC), you will work closely with teams across the United States, Europe, and Asia to deliver high-impact solutions in a collaborative, multicultural environment. We are looking for a Associate Director Social who will: • Develop strong relationships with counterparts in GroupM-Hub regional teams (Europe, U.S., Asia, MEA, AUNZ) • Lead the training and growth of your local social team. • Enforce Social best practices with a focus on platform expertise, consistency, and quality of work delivery. • Be accountable for consistent work delivery to GroupM-Hub regional teams by ensuring a high quality of output. • Serve as point of escalation for your channel and take ownership of resolving challenges. • Provide career development and coaching for your social team. • Line manages 2-5 direct reports with as many as 50-70 indirect reports. • Provide timely and actionable feedback to the team to aid in their development, improvement, and progress. Provide awareness and recognition for jobs well done. • Provide support to the People Planning team in capacity planning &amp;amp; resource management for the team. • Actively involved in conducting interviews to meet hiring requirements and sourcing the right talent pool for your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this opportunity looks right for you, we are looking for candidates who have: • Graduation or Post Graduation Degree in Any stream • 8+ year&#39;s professional experience in digital media execution • You are an expert &amp;amp; executed on Meta as well as on Snapchat, Pinterest, LinkedIn • May have an idea on Reddit, Tiktok, X • You are proficient in Microsoft Excel and Google Sheet • Working knowledge in HubSpot, Smartly, 4C, Scibids, or third-party tools like Dataroma, Google Studio is an added advantage • Experience managing multi-location media activation teams. • Experience training and maintaining quality standards at scale. • Experience providing service to local teams from a centralized location. • Passion for everything digital, with an active interest and understanding of online advertising industry trends. • Excellent communication skills, both verbal and written • Possess a solution-oriented mindset and analytical skillset. • Proactive, display exemplary leadership with a positive go-getter attitude.&lt;/p&gt;
