&lt;div&gt;We are currently looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Director&amp;nbsp;– Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join us&amp;nbsp;for one of the biggest global brands. In this role, you will&amp;nbsp;drive the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;end-to-end strategic planning for all brands in the portfolio, brand activations and consumer media journeys to deliver brand goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
