&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Associate Media Planning Director to lead integrated media strategy and planning across multiple brands within a high-profile client portfolio. This role requires a strong blend of strategic thinking, cross-functional collaboration, and client leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will bring a holistic understanding of the marketing funnel—spanning brand building to performance—and will be responsible for developing connected media strategies that drive both long-term brand equity and short-term business outcomes. A key aspect of the role will be managing senior stakeholder relationships, including direct liaison with client teams, and ensuring seamless coordination across internal teams and partner agencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Strategic Media Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of full-funnel media strategies across awareness, consideration, and conversion objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business goals into integrated media plans across digital and offline channels where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment of media strategies with broader marketing, product, and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cross-Brand Coordination &amp;amp; Client Servicing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a primary point of contact for client stakeholders, ensuring strong day-to-day relationship management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-brand coordination, ensuring consistency in strategic thinking, learning agendas, and execution frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with client teams (including global/regional counterparts where applicable) to align priorities, narratives, and outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regular communication, including presentations, QBRs, and strategic reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Integrated Planning &amp;amp; Channel Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee planning across key channels including video, display, programmatic, and app ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide teams in leveraging audience insights, first-party data, and platform capabilities to inform planning decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Measurement, Insights &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a test-and-learn culture, identifying opportunities for experimentation and innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage advanced analytics and tools (e.g., clean rooms, attribution models) to generate actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate data into clear narratives and recommendations for stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Team Leadership &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor planners, fostering capability building and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high standards of output across planning, reporting, and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee planning accuracy, forecasting, and overall quality control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with activation and specialist teams to ensure seamless execution&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
