&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a 7+ years’ experienced talented and enthusiastic individual to join our WPP team as a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Planning Director.&lt;/strong&gt; This is a Full-time position based in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Mumbai&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; This role plays a crucial part in supporting WPP&#39;s mission to deliver consistency, delivery excellence and diverse businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
