&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1gkutcd&quot; data-start=&quot;557&quot; data-end=&quot;572&quot;&gt;Job Summary&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;573&quot; data-end=&quot;772&quot;&gt;This pivotal role at WPP Media involves actively participating in and managing various audit processes, including group internal audits and client audits (media, financial, rate benchmarking) audits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;774&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;Group Head will also contribute to operational and management review process audits and remediation, with a strong focus on overall process streamlining and ensuring compliance across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;164ueu3&quot; data-start=&quot;1015&quot; data-end=&quot;1039&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1041&quot; data-end=&quot;1061&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1041&quot; data-end=&quot;1061&quot;&gt;Audit Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1062&quot; data-end=&quot;1424&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lsa2xm&quot; data-start=&quot;1062&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;Support and actively participate in internal audits and client-facing audits, covering media and financial reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;eegh1c&quot; data-start=&quot;1180&quot; data-end=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;Assist with functional audits as directed by senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ifo33k&quot; data-start=&quot;1246&quot; data-end=&quot;1424&quot;&gt;Ensure all audit activities are conducted thoroughly, on time, and in full compliance with internal standards and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1426&quot; data-end=&quot;1463&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1426&quot; data-end=&quot;1463&quot;&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Process Streamlining&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1464&quot; data-end=&quot;1887&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16ypxgs&quot; data-start=&quot;1464&quot; data-end=&quot;1614&quot;&gt;Proactively manage and monitor organisational compliance across all relevant statutory, internal, and regulatory frameworks, policies, and guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;r5rww8&quot; data-start=&quot;1615&quot; data-end=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;Identify inefficiencies and champion process streamlining initiatives to drive greater operational effectiveness across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sjhsiq&quot; data-start=&quot;1751&quot; data-end=&quot;1887&quot;&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to embed a culture of compliance and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1889&quot; data-end=&quot;1924&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1889&quot; data-end=&quot;1924&quot;&gt;Data Preparation &amp;amp; Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1925&quot; data-end=&quot;2335&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tc9vzh&quot; data-start=&quot;1925&quot; data-end=&quot;2030&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end preparation, organisation, and management of data required for all audit activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;43vydw&quot; data-start=&quot;2031&quot; data-end=&quot;2182&quot;&gt;Coordinate seamlessly across internal teams and external stakeholders to ensure accurate, timely, and complete information flows during audit cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qr00sc&quot; data-start=&quot;2183&quot; data-end=&quot;2335&quot;&gt;Distil complex and large-scale datasets into clear, structured, and actionable insights for senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2337&quot; data-end=&quot;2376&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2337&quot; data-end=&quot;2376&quot;&gt;Remediation and Process Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2377&quot; data-end=&quot;2738&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a0w7o&quot; data-start=&quot;2377&quot; data-end=&quot;2488&quot;&gt;Contribute to the identification of operational gaps and control weaknesses through management review audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1blevn8&quot; data-start=&quot;2489&quot; data-end=&quot;2611&quot;&gt;Develop and help implement practical, sustainable remediation plans to address audit findings and close identified gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vz9xkh&quot; data-start=&quot;2612&quot; data-end=&quot;2738&quot;&gt;Track progress against remediation actions, reporting status to relevant stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2740&quot; data-end=&quot;2795&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2740&quot; data-end=&quot;2795&quot;&gt;Proactive Audit Readiness &amp;amp; Early Warning Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2796&quot; data-end=&quot;3186&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1trws9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2796&quot; data-end=&quot;2893&quot;&gt;Maintain an anticipatory, forward-looking approach to all ongoing and upcoming audit processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vk04oo&quot; data-start=&quot;2894&quot; data-end=&quot;3009&quot;&gt;Conduct pre-audits and internal reviews proactively to surface potential issues before formal audit cycles begin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kzpvuw&quot; data-start=&quot;3010&quot; data-end=&quot;3186&quot;&gt;Report Early Warning signals and key risk areas to relevant stakeholders in a timely and structured manner, enabling early intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;191b6yx&quot; data-start=&quot;3188&quot; data-end=&quot;3224&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications &amp;amp; Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3226&quot; data-end=&quot;3252&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3226&quot; data-end=&quot;3252&quot;&gt;Education &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3253&quot; data-end=&quot;3559&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pge2j0&quot; data-start=&quot;3253&quot; data-end=&quot;3347&quot;&gt;Chartered Accountant (CA) with a minimum of 2 years of post-qualification experience; &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3341&quot; data-end=&quot;3347&quot;&gt;OR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;32wtmw&quot; data-start=&quot;3348&quot; data-end=&quot;3443&quot;&gt;Semi-Qualified CA (CA Inter/IPCC cleared) with a minimum of 5–6 years of relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vlgurf&quot; data-start=&quot;3444&quot; data-end=&quot;3559&quot;&gt;Prior experience with a mid-size internal audit firm is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3561&quot; data-end=&quot;3580&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3561&quot; data-end=&quot;3580&quot;&gt;Audit Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3581&quot; data-end=&quot;3866&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;psdw8w&quot; data-start=&quot;3581&quot; data-end=&quot;3689&quot;&gt;Demonstrated, hands-on experience in internal audit, process reviews, and control improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;54ir8e&quot; data-start=&quot;3690&quot; data-end=&quot;3866&quot;&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple concurrent audit workstreams with meticulous attention to detail and strong organisational discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3868&quot; data-end=&quot;3908&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3868&quot; data-end=&quot;3908&quot;&gt;Industry Knowledge (Added Advantage)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3909&quot; data-end=&quot;4131&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ro2ype&quot; data-start=&quot;3909&quot; data-end=&quot;4131&quot;&gt;Prior experience within a media agency or media investment organisation will be considered a significant differentiator, enabling faster onboarding and stronger contextual judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4133&quot; data-end=&quot;4158&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4133&quot; data-end=&quot;4158&quot;&gt;Technical Proficiency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4159&quot; data-end=&quot;4510&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rgceab&quot; data-start=&quot;4159&quot; data-end=&quot;4301&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in Microsoft Excel (including pivot tables, formulas, and data modelling); broader MS Office Suite competence required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qq4qyn&quot; data-start=&quot;4302&quot; data-end=&quot;4510&quot;&gt;Strong capability in large-scale data analysis — with the ability to work across complex datasets and translate them into clear, refined, and decision-ready insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4512&quot; data-end=&quot;4552&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4512&quot; data-end=&quot;4552&quot;&gt;Interpersonal &amp;amp; Communication Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4553&quot; data-end=&quot;5071&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xscraj&quot; data-start=&quot;4553&quot; data-end=&quot;4726&quot;&gt;Exceptional verbal and written communication skills — with the ability to present audit findings, draft concise reports, and interact confidently with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c7eewi&quot; data-start=&quot;4727&quot; data-end=&quot;4875&quot;&gt;A demonstrated track record as a collaborative team player, capable of working effectively across functions, geographies, and levels of seniority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ce5v7z&quot; data-start=&quot;4876&quot; data-end=&quot;5071&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;High degree of professional integrity, discretion, and sound judgement, particularly when handling sensitive financial or compliance-related information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
