&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open &lt;/strong&gt;environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our Global Operations Centre (GOC), you will partner with teams across the U.S., Europe, and Asia to deliver high-impact, integrated media planning solutions across multiple markets and channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Director – Media Planning who will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Client Leadership &amp;amp; Planning:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior planning lead and strategic partner for global and multi‑market clients, ensuring media planning excellence aligned with client business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a relentless focus on driving client outcome growth, applying performance‑led planning principles, data‑informed audience insights, optimisation thinking and advanced analytical perspectives to planning decision‑making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a subject‑matter expert across multiple channels and planning practices, with a strong understanding of how channels work together to deliver short‑ and long‑term client outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic guidance and recommendations on the optimal use of media products, services and solutions, ensuring alignment with client needs, business strategy and return on investment expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to senior client stakeholders, nurturing long‑term relationships and supporting clients in navigating complex business challenges, organisational change and evolving market dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate deep understanding of client businesses, including successes, challenges and strategic priorities, and apply experience‑based judgement to identify opportunities, risks and trade‑offs from a business perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead senior‑level planning discussions across multiple stakeholders, effectively synthesising and reconciling diverse or conflicting inputs to drive alignment and shared understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed performance‑led and outcome‑oriented thinking into the planning process by ensuring that insights, intelligence and forecasts from activation and specialist teams are reflected in strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and oversee planning‑level KPIs, governance frameworks and planning processes that enable optimisation, benchmarking and continuous improvement across client portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a data‑driven planning culture, partnering with analytics and data science teams to prioritise initiatives and ensure insights are effectively translated into planning outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high‑level growth and commercial planning perspectives for assigned clients or portfolios, including directional forecasts, profitability considerations and identification of priority growth areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong understanding of WPP Media agency deliverables and committed campaign KPIs, ensuring planning outputs are aligned with agreed client expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the planning discipline with credibility in senior client meetings, contributing technical and strategic expertise when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the senior client engagement cadence from a planning perspective, including strategic sessions, status forums and cross‑functional meetings, ensuring consistent and high‑quality representation of the planning function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of key planning workstreams on complex or multi‑market initiatives, ensuring clarity of scope, appropriate governance and high‑quality outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capability Development:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify capability gaps within media planning teams supporting client portfolios and define actions to address them through development, upskilling or targeted hiring.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global planning practices, investment, product and solutions teams to help develop and drive adoption of new proprietary solutions on behalf of the OpCo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the planning perspective in shaping capability priorities for the Polish GOC, ensuring alignment with broader WPP Media standards, expectations and strategic direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the development and long‑term evolution of the Media Planning discipline within the Polish GOC, including definition of role profiles, competency frameworks and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership and oversight for planning talent, establishing consistent development approaches, evaluation principles and coaching practices that support high performance and career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain planning governance, including methodologies, templates and quality assurance standards, to ensure consistency, scalability and excellence of planning outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of continuous improvement and knowledge sharing within the planning community, supporting best‑practice exchange across teams and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Leadership:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate effectively within a complex, matrixed organizational environment, providing leadership through influence and partnership across client, planning and activation teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with client leadership, activation leads and regional stakeholders to ensure alignment between strategic intent, planning outputs and execution delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the planning discipline with credibility across cross‑functional forums, ensuring consistent understanding of objectives, priorities and expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable effective communication and knowledge sharing between planning and activation teams, fostering clarity, collaboration and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outline, monitor and support adherence to agreed client and WPP Media standards, ensuring planning excellence is consistently reflected across engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior stakeholders to identify gaps, risks or misalignments, and contribute to the development of action plans and improvement frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior counterpart to Activation Directors and Leads, promoting shared accountability for client outcomes and strong collaboration across disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead by example in building a collaborative, inclusive and high‑performance culture, encouraging teamwork, ownership and professional growth across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Insights:&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize advanced data analytics to understand media performance deeply, and guide optimization strategies ensuring maximum ROI.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides expert insights on the application of data science and how to effectively use client and all biddable data signals.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future-Forward Thinking:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of media and technology trends, providing guidance on emerging opportunities and threats.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively develops blueprints and action plans to help propel achieving client business objectives by bringing together practitioners across practices, proprietary solutions and extended WPP Media capabilities, at a regional level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in across paid media, strategy, retail, or consulting, including senior roles requiring leadership and accountability for teams and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in digital media, adtech, martech and data platforms &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing complex, multi-market accounts where you’ve delivered measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of multi-practice area/industry usage and trends, and how it impacts customer businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate in a way that is highly persuasive, engaging and comprehensive (written and verbal).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in different types of media strategy – and understands that the road to strong brand is paved with performance marketing principles at the core.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sophisticated understanding of the media investment, ad tech and agency ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience overseeing technology and/or operations transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to tell complex narratives in a simple and compelling way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for digital and data, well versed on the latest global advancements &amp;amp; dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead through influence, demonstrating strong interpersonal skills, empathy and credibility across seniority levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience owning and leading senior client planning relationships across large, complex, and matrixed client teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven capability leadership: building a planning team, hiring for defined profiles, and developing a discipline at scale, including people development, performance management and succession planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
