&lt;p&gt;Job Description (Senior Executive): Foreign Language Expert – Digital Marketing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Role Title:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Executive – Foreign Language Expert (Digital Marketing)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages Required:&lt;/strong&gt; German&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department: &lt;/strong&gt;Digital Marketing (Search, Social, Programmatic)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;Associate Director&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Overview&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is the world’s largest media investment company and part of WPP, responsible for one in every three ads globally.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for Foreign Language Experts to bridge communication between the offshore hub and European markets, ensuring that digital marketing campaigns are linguistically accurate, culturally relevant, and effectively executed across regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Role Purpose&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role plays a critical part in enabling seamless market integration by combining language expertise with digital marketing understanding. The individual will support campaign execution, client communication, and localization to drive impactful outcomes across EMEA markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translation &amp;amp; Localization:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Translate campaign content, ad copies, and marketing materials&lt;br&gt;• Ensure cultural relevance and brand tone consistency&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Communication:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Act as a bridge between offshore teams and market stakeholders&lt;br&gt;• Participate in client calls and presentations&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign &amp;amp; Digital Support:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Support Search, Social, and Programmatic teams&lt;br&gt;• Assist in campaign setup, QA, and optimization&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Fluent in German&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• Minimum B2 level or equivalent&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Marketing Understanding:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Basic to intermediate understanding of digital marketing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Experience Requirements&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Executive: 2–3-year, experience in digital marketing or localization preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Additional Requirements&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with tools like Wrike or Jira is a plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communication &amp;amp; stakeholder management&lt;br&gt;• Attention to detail&lt;br&gt;• Cultural awareness&lt;br&gt;• Collaboration&lt;br&gt;• Problem-solving&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
