&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Analyst to own end-to-end tracking implementation across web and app properties for our client portfolio, from tagging architecture through to reporting and root-cause diagnosis when data goes wrong. This is a hands-on, technical analytics role: you&#39;ll be the person who makes sure the data clients and internal teams rely on is actually accurate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Tagging &amp;amp; Tracking Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain Google Tag Manager (GTM) containers (both client-side and server-side) across client properties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and troubleshoot marketing/ad platform pixels and scripts (CM360, Meta Pixel, Snap Pixel, TikTok Pixel, or similar), ensuring accurate campaign-level tracking and tag firing across channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and QA Google Analytics 4 (GA4) event tracking, custom dimensions/metrics, and conversion events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement Meta Conversions API (CAPI) for server-side event tracking, ensuring accurate deduplication against Pixel data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and manage Google Tag Gateway (GTG) implementations for first-party tag serving via CDN, improving signal accuracy against ITP/ad-blocker data loss&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and configure Mobile Measurement Partner (MMP) SDKs (e.g. AppsFlyer, Adjust, Branch) for app attribution and in-app event tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain tracking taxonomy consistency across web and app, and own the central documentation (data layer specs, event dictionaries, naming conventions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain recurring performance and attribution reports/dashboards for client and internal stakeholders (GA4, Looker Studio, Excel/PowerPoint)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate raw tracking data into clear, actionable insight for marketing and client teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate recurring reporting workflows to reduce manual turnaround&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; RCA &amp;amp; Implementation Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and resolve tracking discrepancies (e.g. unattributed / &quot;(not set)&quot; sessions, cross-platform data mismatches)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct root cause analysis on data quality issues across web and app implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run periodic implementation audits (GTM container health, event QA, CAPI match-rate checks, MMP SDK verification) and deliver clear findings and fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in web/app analytics, tagging, or marketing technology (agency or in-house)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on expertise with GTM (client-side and server-side) and GA4&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with Meta CAPI or other server-side conversion APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Google Tag Gateway or server-side tagging architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with major ad platform tags/pixels (CM360, Meta, Snap, TikTok, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing or managing an MMP platform (AppsFlyer, Adjust, Branch, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong RCA/analytical skills; comfortable in GA4 Explore/BigQuery, and SQL a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building stakeholder-facing reports and dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills; client-facing experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running tracking across multiple client accounts/verticals concurrently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with consent management platforms and privacy-compliant tracking setups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Light scripting/automation ability (Python, GTM custom JS/HTML templates)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
