&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This role sits within the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Client Leadership &amp;amp; Planning practice at WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;, where you will lead integrated media strategy and client partnerships for one of the organisation&#39;s key accounts. As &lt;strong&gt;Senior Director – Planning (Client Services)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive end-to-end strategic planning, business growth, and client success by delivering integrated marketing solutions across offline, digital, commerce, and emerging media channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You will act as a trusted advisor to senior client stakeholders, translating business objectives into insight-led media strategies that deliver measurable outcomes. Working closely with specialists across Planning, Investment, Commerce, Data, Analytics, Creative, and Technology, you will ensure seamless execution while fostering innovation and collaboration across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This role also plays a critical leadership function by developing high-performing teams, strengthening client relationships, driving strategic excellence, and championing the adoption of WPP Open and AI-enabled planning capabilities to deliver future-ready marketing solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
