&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Client Leadership &amp;amp; Strategic Planning&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of integrated media and communication strategies aligned with client business objectives and long-term growth ambitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders, acting as a strategic advisor across planning, investment, and business transformation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business challenges into actionable, insight-led media strategies that deliver measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategic planning across annual business plans, campaign roadmaps, product launches, and integrated marketing initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Integrated Media Planning &amp;amp; Campaign Excellence&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop end-to-end media strategies across traditional, digital, commerce, social, search, and emerging media platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with specialist teams to deliver integrated planning solutions that maximise marketing effectiveness and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure media plans are supported by audience intelligence, market insights, data analytics, and robust measurement frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive excellence in campaign execution by maintaining high standards of planning quality, governance, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Data, Insights &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage consumer insights, audience data, category intelligence, and market trends to identify growth opportunities for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret complex data and research to develop compelling strategic recommendations and business narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion innovation by introducing new planning methodologies, AI-powered capabilities, and emerging media solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encourage the adoption of WPP Open and advanced planning tools to improve strategic decision-making and campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Client Growth &amp;amp; Business Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to expand client partnerships through proactive strategic recommendations and innovative marketing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new business pitches by developing integrated communication strategies and presenting compelling client solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive thought leadership by sharing industry trends, best practices, and award-winning work across internal and client teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of continuous improvement by initiating cross-category learning, strategic case studies, and innovation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Team Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a high-performing planning team while promoting collaboration, accountability, and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture of strategic excellence by coaching team members on planning frameworks, storytelling, client management, and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across the wider WPP Media network to unlock specialist capabilities and integrated client solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure effective resource planning, performance management, and talent development across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Competencies&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in integrated media planning, client leadership, and strategic communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of offline and digital media ecosystems, audience planning, marketing effectiveness, and business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen with the ability to translate business objectives into integrated marketing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and strategic thinking capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding stakeholder management, client servicing, and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation, storytelling, and executive communication skills with experience engaging senior client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead multidisciplinary teams within a fast-paced, collaborative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for innovation, continuous learning, and driving measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Business, Communications, Advertising, or a related discipline. A postgraduate qualification or MBA is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;14+ years of experience in Media Planning, Client Leadership, Integrated Communications, or Strategic Marketing, including experience in a senior leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing large client portfolios and developing integrated media strategies across traditional and digital channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of media planning, media buying, audience measurement, brand investment, and marketing analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading cross-functional teams, mentoring talent, and driving business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with leading brands across automotive, FMCG, technology, or similar sectors will be an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of AI-enabled planning tools, audience intelligence platforms, and data-driven marketing methodologies is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
