&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We’re building something exciting in the Advanced TV (formerly Finecast) space, and we’re looking for high-impact talent to help scale Connected TV (CTV) within WPP.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designation&lt;/strong&gt;: Senior Director - Region Lead – West (12–15 years experience)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes this exciting?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This isn’t just another role — it’s an opportunity to shape and establish CTV at scale within one of the world’s largest media ecosystems. The growth we’re seeing is exceptional, and the runway ahead is massive.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lead engagement for West ATV Team &lt;br&gt;Drive CTV adoption and strategy across West markets&lt;br&gt;Work with top brands and agencies to build next-gen TV solutions&lt;br&gt;Be at the forefront of a rapidly evolving media landscape&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll be part of a high-caliber, entrepreneurial team, with the backing of WPP’s global strength — giving you both impact and scale.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you’re looking to step into a role where you can truly make a difference, this is it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
