&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Manage end-to-end media investment execution across Television and digital platforms. Negotiate rates, secure competitive benchmarks, ensure optimal inventory utilization, maintain strong vendor relationships, and deliver high-quality investment outputs in compliance with processes and budgets. Additionally, support client-facing teams with insights, market intelligence, and ensure delivery aligns with client expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities – Media Investment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead rate negotiations and deal structuring with television broadcasters and digital publishers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute investments across TV genres, display, video, OTT, and social platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure competitive CPRPs (TV) and CPMs (digital) while ensuring optimal inventory utilization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate value-added opportunities, sponsorships, integrations, and special properties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report investment efficiency metrics (CPRP, CPM, delivery vs. commitment, spillages, viewability)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align TV and digital schedules to ensure seamless campaign delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accuracy in deal reporting, documentation, and reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to financial processes, booking protocols, and audit compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and sustain strong relationships with broadcasters, OTT platforms, and digital publishers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with client servicing and planning teams to ensure investments align with client objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular client updates on market trends, pricing benchmarks, and deal efficiencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support client discussions by demonstrating value delivered through negotiations and added benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a bridge between internal teams and external partners to ensure smooth execution and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant Experience requirement 10-12 years&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise in television investment, negotiations, CPRP optimization, and inventory management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of digital investment (display, video, OTT, social) and key metrics (CPM, CPC, CTR, viewability)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong vendor relationship management and commercial acumen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate investment outcomes into client value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with strong focus on accuracy, compliance, and operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and communication skills&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
